# Evidence records are prose: a run's raw output (logs, traces, TSVs) stays out of the repository.
# A record quotes the numbers it needs and names the commit and host that produced them.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.py
# Read by tests: segment-log-core/src/acceptance/seeded.rs and scripts/test_m1_verify_syscalls.py.
!m1/seeded/pressure-1000*
!m1/slice10/linux/syscalls.trace
